\f1\fs22 The day waxed bearably better for Sarah\'97thanks largely to her patch and Kathy\'92s irrepressible ability for being erudite, cute and munted all at the same time\'97until mid afternoon arrived laden with three unwise men bearing gifts.\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>\'91One of them presented his card,\'92 Nancy told Sarah, and handed it over. Guessing what it would read, Sarah dreaded looking at it.\
