\f2\i dia
\f1\i0 .\'92\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>\'91Shut the prophetic \'85 fuck \'85 up.\'92 Kleoboulos shrugged his anger off and began again with a forced measure of pace. \'91What 
