<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>\'91The one in whom he was well-pleased.\'92\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>\'91Testify, Solo!\'92\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>\'91Stop it!\'92 This time, it was Kathy who wrested back control from the chaos.\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>Sarah winced and held her abdomen. It felt like Little Clinton was performing some kind of happy dance in her belly. Surely it was too soon for those kinds of shenanigans. It was all Sarah could manage to keep her lunch down.\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>\'91You heard her,\'92 Kathy said to the Sages. \'91She\'92s not keeping it.\'92\
